'''''Limonium maritimum''''' is a species of ''[[Limonium]]'' from [[Portugal]]. It is similar to the closely related to ''[[Limonium vulgare]]'' and ''[[Limonium narbonense|L. narbonense]]''.<ref>{{cite journal |last1=Cortinhas |first1=A. |last2=Erben |first2=M. |last3=Paes |first3=A.P. |last4=Espírito Santo |first4=D. |last5=Guara-Requena |first5=M. |last6=Caperta |first6=A.D. |title=Taxonomic complexity in the halophyte ''Limonium vulgare'' and related taxa (Plumbaginaceae): insights from analysis of morphological, reproductive and karyological data |journal=Annals of Botany |date=2015 |volume=115 |issue=3 |pages=369–383 |doi=10.1093/aob/mcu186|pmid=25261345 |pmc=4332604 }}</ref>

